            "prompt_blocks": [
              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Given $X(j\\omega)=4e^{j\\pi/4}e^{-j\\omega/3}$ and $H(j\\omega)=5e^{-j\\pi/6}e^{j\\omega/3}$, what is $Y(j\\omega)=X(j\\omega)H(j\\omega)$ after simplifying?",
